Package: libgtop-2.0-11
Version: @DEB_LIBGTOP_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: Libraries
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/libgtop
Description: libgtop-2.0 process monitoring backend for GNOME on iOS
 Focused libgtop-2.0 implementation providing the process-list, parent/effective
 uid, and argv entry points GNOME Console uses. It reads the jailbroken iOS
 process tree through Darwin kern.proc and kern.procargs2 sysctls, restoring
 child-process styling and running-command close warnings without requiring the
 Linux libgtop backend.
